  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 705.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 705.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to accommodate those situations where strict adherence to this chapter is not needed to protect public health or the environment.\n\nSource. #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10832, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14420, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
